Exact source URLs, dates, attribution and SHA-256 pins are recorded in
tools/packs/sources.lock.json and in each generated pack manifest. Text is
selected, HTML-stripped and whitespace-normalized, not generated. The pack
has no agency endorsement and provides dated reference excerpts, not current
travel conditions, comprehensive safety instructions or current legal advice.
